    {
      "id": "zoom-and-wheel-behavior-idea-evidence",
      "type": "idea-evidence",
      "label": "A Scrollbar That Does Nothing",
      "position": {
        "x": 740,
        "y": 260
      },
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 210
        },
        {
          "id": "supports",
          "key": "supports",
          "label": "supports",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 180,
          "role": "relationship",
          "allowedEdgeTypes": [
            "reference"
          ],
          "metadata": {
            "relationship": true,
            "role": "relationship"
          }
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "title": "A visible scrollbar that does not scroll",
        "observation": "On the deployed dev site, a page view hosted in a workspace graph (the Page Template) shows a vertical scrollbar, and the wheel over it does not scroll the page. This was reported from a real screen, and it only happens when the camera is zoomed out to the workspace: zoomed into the graph, scrolling web content works. Cause found: at workspace level the page view of a graph is drawn as an inert background (inert and pointer-events none in WorkspaceLayer.js), so the wheel can never reach it and goes to the canvas, which zooms, even though the view draws a scrollbar. A first fix now gives the wheel to that view when it can scroll the way the wheel goes, and checked in the running app the page scrolls to its end and only then does the wheel zoom.",
        "kind": "observation",
        "strength": "moderate",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "zoom-and-wheel-behavior"
        },
        "presentation": {
          "glyph": {
            "kind": "icon",
            "name": "FactCheck"
          }
        },
        "citationSourceId": "",
        "classRef": "github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/idea-template/classes/nodes/idea-evidence.node-class.node"
      },
      "handles": [
