      "data": {
        "title": "Nested surfaces can share one rule",
        "statement": "A single rule (the surface under the pointer first, then the camera) works for every surface Twilite hosts, including workspace graphs, page views, documents and same-origin frames, and cross-origin frames can be given a workable edge case.",
        "importance": "medium",
        "status": "untested",
